# China everyday services for Surge RULE-SET
# Created: 2026-11-23 (Asia/Singapore)
# Suggested policy: DIRECT, assigned in the profile rather than this file.
# Domain-based starter coverage; not a guarantee of all mobile/voice/payment paths.
# Mini-programs and merchants can use their own domains outside this list.

